<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Tonitel HMS - Your Institution is Ready</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .header p {
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .welcome-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .welcome-section h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .institution-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea15 0%, #764ba215 100%);
            border: 2px solid #667eea30;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .institution-badge h3 {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .institution-badge p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .credentials-box {
            background-color: #f8f9ff;
            border: 1px solid #e8ecff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .credentials-box h3 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .credential-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecff;
        }
        .credential-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .credential-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .credential-value {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .login-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .login-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #fff8e6;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box p {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 24px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8ecff;
        }
        .footer p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .icon {
            font-size: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🏥 Welcome to Tonitel HMS</h1>
            <p>Your institution has been successfully registered</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="welcome-section">
                <h2>Hello, <%= username %>! 👋</h2>
                <p>Your institution <strong><%= institutionName %></strong> has been successfully registered on the Tonitel Hospital Management System. You can now access your admin dashboard.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="institution-badge">
                <h3>🏛️ <%= institutionName %></h3>
                <p>Institution Code: <strong><%= institutionCode || 'N/A' %></strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="credentials-box">
                <h3><span class="icon">🔐</span> Your Login Credentials</h3>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Email Address</span>
                    <span class="credential-value"><%= email %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Password</span>
                    <span class="credential-value"><%= password %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Institution</span>
                    <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionName %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Region</span>
                    <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionRegion || 'N/A' %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="credential-item">
                    <span class="credential-label">Country</span>
                    <span class="credential-value"><%= institutionCountry || 'N/A' %></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p>⚠️ <strong>Security Notice:</strong> For your security, please change your password immediately after your first login. Do not share your credentials with anyone.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>/login" class="login-button">Login to Your Dashboard →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box" style="background-color: #e6f7ff; border-left-color: #1890ff;">
                <p>📞 <strong>Need Help?</strong> If you have any questions or need assistance with your account, please contact our support team at support@tonitel.com or call +233 30 123 4567.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Tonitel HMS. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Powered by <a href="https://tonitel.com">Tonitel</a> | Secure Healthcare Management</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
